    "description": "\ud83d\udcf7<b>Beauty Camera</b>\r\nThis is a native Android system camera app. The HD camera uses all the advantages of your phone or tablet. Let you take photos and videos fast and easy.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7<b>Sweet Selfie</b>\r\nHD Camera is a fully featured camera app, Take incredible selfie photos with amazing filters! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc95\ud83d\udcf7<b>4K HD Camera Blur Effect - Video Camera</b>\r\nXCamera is a professional camera app for all Android devices. With rich filters and professional beauty effects, you can take amazing selfie photos!\ud83d\udc96\ud83c\udf8a\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2\ud83d\udcf7<b>HD Camera - Photo Gallery</b>\r\nThis DSLR HD Camera : 4K HD Camera is specially designed to take high quality photos and videos. With this DSLR HD Camera : 4K HD Camera you can make amazing photos\r\n\r\n<b>Video Camera</b>\r\n<b>Selfie camera and beauty camera</b> with AR Sticker, beauty filters and photo editor app.\ud83d\udc93\ud83d\udc95\ud83d\udcf7\ud83c\udf88\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf8a\ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Filter and Video Camera</b>\r\nProfessional photography on your mobile phone and HD camera for this Android app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Intelligent scene modes Beauty Camera</b>\r\n- 7 shooting modes: photo, video, pro mode, food, square, panorama, short video\r\n- 19 real-time filters: meet your needs of all scenes\r\n- Powerful HDR: capture the details of highlights and shadows in dynamic shooting\r\n\r\n<b>HD Camera - Photo Gallery</b>\r\n<b>Selfie Camera & Beauty Camera</b> is the best beauty camera and photo/video editing app. Beauty Camera and Sweet Camera is the best selfie editor that includes professional editing tools and various effects. Beauty camera\r\n\r\n<b>Sweet Selfie - Beauty Camera downloading</b>\r\nYou can easily shoot great photos with DSLR Camera HD, high definition with faster response time, blur editor & filter effect, DSLR HD Camera : 4K HD Camera is free to download!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Other features: <b>HD Camera - Photo Gallery</b>\r\n\u2764 Professional effects with different styles\r\n\u2764 Stylish HDR \u2013 Improve images captured in low-light and backlit scenes\r\n\u2764 Real-time Filter \u2013 Preview filter effect before taking pictures or shooting videos\r\n\u2764 Support for focus modes, color effects, white balance, ISO, and exposure compensation/lock, torch\r\n\u2764 Quick Snap, Continuous shooting, Auto-stabilize\r\n\u2764 Picture/video adjustment\r\n\u2764 Pinch to zoom\r\n\u2764 Countdown timer\r\n\u2764 Burst shoot and quicksnap\r\n\u2764 Steady shooting\r\n\u2764 Photo collage\r\n\u2764 Record location info\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Professional Photo Editor - Selfie Photo Editor</b>\r\n* Blur photo editor: An essential blur photo editor with advanced blur photo brush.\r\n* Crop photo editor: The perfect selfie has never been easier, tap to resize and trim with this crop photo editor.\r\n* Background Changer: Change your background shape to teardrop-shaped, corrugated shape.\r\n* Other features: You can adjust the brightness, contrast, vignette, fade, temperature, saturation, sharpen, etc. It\u2019s the best photo editor free.\r\n\r\n<b>4K HD Camera Blur Effect - Video Camera</b>\ud83d\udcf7\r\nBeauty Camera - Selfie Photo Editor allows you to add art filters to make your selfie more pop.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf8a <b>Personalized editing - Sweet Selfie</b>\ud83d\udcf7\r\n- Filters: there are 34 beauty filters in the camera\r\n- Adjustment: crop, straighten, rotate, mirror, remove red eyes, draw\r\n- Video: when shooting videos, you can click the screen to intercept a photo under the current lens\r\n\r\n<b>HD Camera - Sweet Selfie</b>\r\n<b>Download Beauty Camera - Sweet Selfie</b> Now! The Best Sweet Selfie & Selfie Photo Edit App Only for You. Sweet Selfie, Edit, Share, and Enjoy Your Life! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\ude80\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7\ud83d\udcf1<b>Blur Editor - Photo Gallery</b>\r\nWith this app now you can also make your photo background blur easily and professionally!\r\n\r\n<b>Video Camera</b>\r\nprofessionally. This DSLR HD Camera : 4K HD Camera is developed with special attention to satisfy users to get best HD picture quality from their device camera.\r\n\r\nOne touch to take beautiful photos! \ud83d\udc96\ud83c\udf8a\ud83d\udcaf Let\u2019s capture more special moments in HD Camera! \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udcf8\ud83d\udc8e\r\n\r\nThis multifunctional camera will provide you with amazing shooting joy. Come and download it now. Capture your beautiful moments, enjoy your interesting life!\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcf7",
